---
---

<div class="screenshot-evidence-demo reveal" aria-label="截图如何被整理成证据">
  <section class="evidence-canvas">
    <div class="mock-desktop-window">
      <div class="browser-toolbar">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
        <em>工作窗口 · 任何 App</em>
      </div>
      <div class="evidence-screen-grid">
        <div class="evidence-page-card large">
          <b>页面 / 文档 / App 内容</b>
          <p>用户框选的是现场，不是直接把图片交出去。</p>
          <div class="screen-lines">
            <i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="evidence-side-card">
          <b>本机记录</b>
          <span>主 App · 窗口 · 屏幕 · 权限</span>
        </div>
        <div class="evidence-selection-overlay" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>选区</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="evidence-ledger">
    <p class="card-label">整理成证据</p>
    <h3>截图保存后，WorkRecorder 生成的是可追溯记录。</h3>
    <div class="evidence-ledger-grid">
      <article>
        <span>PNG</span>
        <strong>截图引用</strong>
        <em>点开记录可见；完整原图仍需确认</em>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>TEXT</span>
        <strong>截图文字</strong>
        <em>进入默认可见</em>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>APP</span>
        <strong>本机记录</strong>
        <em>窗口、主 App、重叠来源</em>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>SRC</span>
        <strong>App 补充信息</strong>
        <em>浏览器全文只是一个例子</em>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
